<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Bendigo Bank half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Bendigo Bank half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     9.67 vs 9.69</p>
<p>    Net					6.28 vs 5.88</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     12.0 vs 11.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Bendigo Bank Ltd is a regional bank based in Bendigo, Victoria.</p>
